Summary & Motivation

The original implementation of MyPartitionedIOManager used context.has_partition_key, which caused errors when an unpartitioned asset was processed.
This PR updates the logic to use context.has_asset_partitions, ensuring correct handling of both partitioned and unpartitioned assets.


How I Tested These Changes

Ran pytest on affected modules.
Verified partitioned and unpartitioned asset materialization via dagster job execute.
Added log statements to confirm correct behavior.

